{"qid": "mt_00053_t3", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 2, "group_id": "g0053", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 39.34, "n_tokens": 212, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["婚姻法"], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.5333333333333333, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 318, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.53", "answer": "《婚姻法》已不能作为现行裁判依据。我国原《婚姻法》已被《民法典》婚姻家庭编吸收替代，自2021年1月1日《民法典》施行之日起，《婚姻法》同时废止（见《民法典》第一千二百六十条）。因此，2021年1月1日之后审理的离婚案件，应适用《民法典》婚姻家庭编的相关规定，而不再援引原《婚姻法》。\n\n就您的情况（离婚纠纷）而言，相关规则主要见《民法典》：\n- 第一千零七十九条：离婚诉讼及感情破裂、调解的规定；\n- 第一千零七十六条至第一千零七十八条：协议离婚（含三十日撤回申请等离婚冷静期规则）；\n- 第一千零八十七条：离婚时夫妻共同财产的分割，照顾子女、女方和无过错方权益；\n- 第一千零六十二条、第一千零六十三条：夫妻共同财产与个人财产的界定", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.038, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2023）苏05民终1664号_0", "score": 0.1458, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）苏05民终1664号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）苏05民终2513号_0", "score": 0.1458, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）苏05民终2513号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）浙01民再1545号_0", "score": 0.1458, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）浙01民再1545号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）浙01民终2390号_0", "score": 0.1389, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）浙01民终2390号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）京01民终1991号_0", "score": 0.1389, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）京01民终1991号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）浙01民终321号_0", "score": 0.1389, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）浙01民终321号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）津02民终1147号_0", "score": 0.1319, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）津02民终1147号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）苏01民终1477号_0", "score": 0.1319, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）苏01民终1477号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00081_t3", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 2, "group_id": "g0081", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 32.68, "n_tokens": 102, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.5454545454545454, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 153, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.55", "answer": "《民法典》没有失效，目前仍然有效。\n\n《中华人民共和国民法典》自2021年1月1日起施行，是现行有效的法律。你提到的转租规则，依据是《民法典》第七百一十六条，该条现行有效。\n\n补充说明：本案距今约16个月，若相关法律事实发生在《民法典》施行之后，应适用《民法典》的规定（参见《民法典时间效力规定》第一条）。", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.032, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2023）津02民终2344号_0", "score": 0.7129, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）津02民终2344号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）沪01民终2384号_0", "score": 0.5576, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）沪01民终2384号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）鲁01民终1939号_0", "score": 0.5461, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）鲁01民终1939号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）津02民再343号_0", "score": 0.5364, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）津02民再343号"}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典时间效力规定_2020_1", "score": 0.213, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典时间效力规定", "article": 1, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典时间效力规定_2020_3", "score": 0.1889, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典时间效力规定", "article": 3, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典时间效力规定_2020_2", "score": 0.1862, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典时间效力规定", "article": 2, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_153", "score": 0.1852, "type": "provision", "