{"qid": "mt_00073_t3", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 2, "group_id": "g0073", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 42.18, "n_tokens": 220, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["婚姻法"], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.5333333333333333, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 330, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.53", "answer": "《婚姻法》已不能作为现行裁判依据。\n\n《中华人民共和国民法典》自2021年1月1日起施行，原《婚姻法》同时废止（见《民法典》第一千二百六十条）。因此，2021年1月1日之后审理的离婚案件，应适用《民法典》婚姻家庭编的相关规定，而不再援引《婚姻法》。\n\n就你所述情形（以感情确已破裂为由起诉离婚、主张家庭暴力、请求损害赔偿并在财产分割中予以照顾），现行依据主要是：\n\n1. 准予离婚的法定情形：《民法典》第一千零七十九条，其中明确将“实施家庭暴力”列为调解无效应准予离婚的情形之一。\n2. 离婚损害赔偿：《民法典》第一千零九十一条，因实施家庭暴力导致离婚的，无过错方有权请求损害赔偿。\n3. 财产分割照顾无过错方：《民法典》第一千零八十七条，分割夫妻共同财产时应", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.041, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2023）京01民终1991号_0", "score": 0.1357, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）京01民终1991号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）苏05民终1664号_0", "score": 0.1357, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）苏05民终1664号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）浙01民终321号_0", "score": 0.1357, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）浙01民终321号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）苏01民终1477号_0", "score": 0.1357, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）苏01民终1477号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）津02民终1117号_0", "score": 0.1357, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）津02民终1117号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）浙01民终2390号_0", "score": 0.1357, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021